From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 07:43:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 38/39] dt-bindings: input: apple,z2-multitouch: Add iPhone 8
 Plus (D21)

The iPhone 8 Plus (D21, T8015) touch controller is a Z2 part of the
iPhone 7 Plus family (personality C1F5E, HBPP 0x103) and runs in SPI
mode 3. It takes a high-voltage supply, the Chestnut display PMIC switch
(ADT function-power_ana). Its core rail (ADT function-power_ldo) is an
SMC function that the driver switches itself, so it is not a supply.

Originally from iPhOmarchy patches/0020 ("input: apple-z2: D21 chestnut
touch-HV supply; PMIC + regulator + DTS", fb913fdd5f4f) and patches/0040
(b2533c59a2a0), iPhOmarchy 5921728.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml      | 13 +++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
index f01e5508e..7fc6ea8b4 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/input/touchscreen/apple,z2-multitouch.yaml
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ properties:
       - apple,j172-touchscreen
       - apple,d11-touchscreen
       - apple,d111-touchscreen
+      - apple,d21-touchscreen
       - apple,n61-touchscreen
       - apple,n102-touchscreen
       - apple,n66-touchscreen
@@ -351,6 +352,18 @@ allOf:
         - spi-cpol
         - apple,z2-no-init-ack
 
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          const: apple,d21-touchscreen
+    then:
+      required:
+        - clocks
+        - hv-supply
+        - spi-cpha
+        - spi-cpol
+        - apple,z2-no-init-ack
+
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
